DeskTopSize 1x1
WindowFont fixed
IconFont fixed
Style "*" ClickToFocus, BorderWidth 4, HandleWidth 5

AddToFunc "InitFunction" "I" Exec exec xsetroot -solid '#253041'
+ "I" Exec exec p9term

AddToMenu "Project9" "Project9" Title
+ "&Terminal" Exec exec p9term
+ "&XTerm" Exec exec xterm
+ "" Nop
+ "&End X session" Quit

Mouse 1 R A Menu Project9
Mouse 1 T A Move
Mouse 1 S A Resize
Mouse 1 1 A Close
Mouse 3 T A Iconify
Key F12 A C Menu Project9
